          "code": "IDENTIFYUSERINTENT",
          "id": "1763815769837",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1763815769842_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Input Details:**\nManager Types : {{$context.$variables.managerTypeValues}}\n\nYou are an expert in converting a user question to a structured query output. \nThe accuracy of your output is important and will be used to query objects from a suggestion system.\n\nYou are an intent extraction assistant.  \nGiven a user input message, perform the following tasks based on the definitions provided:\n\n**Intent Types:**  \n- CONTEXT_ACTIVITY: To get context details of login user pending transactions, journey tasks, communicate posts\n- TEAM_ACTIVITY: To get details across the team related to employment, compensation, talent/performance, position, requisitions, or offers.\n- PERSON_ACTIVITY: To get more specific details of any worker in the team.\n- REPORT_ACTIVITY: To get details about executing the reports.\n- POLICY_ACTIVITY: To get details from policy documents.\n\n**Intent Categories:**  \n- For CONTEXT_ACTIVITY: NOTIF (Worklist notifications) ,COMM (Communicate posts) , JORNY (Journey tasks) \n- For TEAM_ACTIVITY: EMP (Employment), CMP (Compensation), TAL (Talent/performance), ABS (Absences), POS (Position), OFR (Offers), REQ (Requisitions)\n   Note: if intent type is TEAM_ACTIVITY, always include EMP category\n- For PERSON_ACTIVITY:  DF_ANA (Analytics), DF_EVT (Events), DF_BAN (Banners), EMP (Employment), CMP (Compensation), TAL (Talent/performance), ABS (Absences)\n- For REPORT_ACTIVITY: REP (Report)\n- For POLICY_ACTIVITY: POL (Policy)\n\n- Identify the Intent Categories as per the user request.\n\n**Intent Level:**\nFor Intent Type : TEAM_ACTIVITY\n- DIRECTS: For direct reportees of a manager ( default, if requested for direct reportees)\n- ALL: For all levels of reportees of a manager (if requested for all reportees or hierarchy)\nExamples:\n- “Show direct reports” → DIRECTS\n- “List all reports” → ALL\n- “Show my team hierarchy” → ALL\n- “Who reports to me directly?” → DIRECTS\n- “List my full team” → ALL\n\n**Intent Manager Type:**\nFor Intent Type : TEAM_ACTIVITY\n- Identify the most relevant manager type meaning of Manager Types based on user input, default use Line manager.\n\n**Return Format:**  \nProvide your answer as a JSON object using the structure below and include ALL detected intents.\n\nExample:\n```json\n{\n  \"userIntent\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEAM_ACTIVITY\",\n      \"categories\": [\"EMP\", \"CMP\"],\n      \"level\": \"DIRECTS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"REPORT_ACTIVITY\",\n      \"categories\": [\"REP\"],\n      \"level\": \"DIRECTS\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n**Current User Message:** \nUser Prompt : `{{$context.$variables.userPrompt}}`\n\n**Required Output:** A json object with structure {userIntent: array}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"userIntent\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"level\": \"string\",\n      \"managerType\" : \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "IdentifyFlowPath",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let flowPath=\"QUERY\";\n\nreturn flowPath;"
          },
